ps://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/deployments","created_at":"2010-02-20T17:25:38Z","updated_at":"2025-12-10T20:51:14Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-06T19:28:46Z","git_url":"git://github.com/less/less.js.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:less/less.js.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/less/less.js.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/less/less.js","homepage":"http://lesscss.org","size":17989,"stargazers_count":17046,"watchers_count":17046,"language":"JavaScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":false,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":3394,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":245,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["css","language","stylesheet-language"],"visibility":"public","forks":3394,"open_issues":245,"watchers":17046,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/pulls/3700","html_url":"https://github.com/less/less.js/pull/3700","diff_url":"https://github.com/less/less.js/pull/3700.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/less/less.js/pull/3700.patch","merged_at":"2023-01-15T00:55:14Z"},"body":"**What**:\r\n\r\nAdded a fix for the parser crashing when a css variable property does not end with a semicolon. Fixes #3698 and Fixes  #3373.\r\n\r\n**Why**:\r\n\r\nThis helps to avoid crashes when importing pre-minified css files from e.g. an npm package. In our case, [cssnano](https://cssnano.co/) always drops the trailing semicolon on the last property. This cannot be disabled without disabling all of whitespace normalization (`normalizeWhitespace` option). Fixing the bug in Less.js fixes this use case for us.\r\n\r\n**How**:\r\n\r\nWhen calling `permissiveValue` on a detected css variable, the `untilTokens` parameter is left unset. This defaults it to detecting `;` for ending the value. I've set the parameter to `/[;}]/` instead in order to close variables on either the semicolon (`;`) or the closing curly bracket (`}`) character. This may not be the most optimal fix, but it gets the job done in the test cases I've added. Additionally, it doesn't break any of the existing test cases.\r\n\r\n**Checklist**:\r\n\r\n- [ ] Documentation N/A\r\n- [x] Added/updated unit tests\r\n- [x] Code complete\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/3700/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":4,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/3700/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/comments/1283873011","html_url":"https://github.com/less/less.js/issues/3373#issuecomment-1283873011","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/3373","id":1283873011,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAAgNHM5Mhljz","user":{"login":"moelders","id":2640252,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDAyNTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2640252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/moelders","html_url":"https://github.com/moelders","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moelders/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moelders/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moelders/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moelders/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moelders/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moelders/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moelders/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moelders/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moelders/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-10-19T11:40:59Z","updated_at":"2022-10-19T11:40:59Z","body":"Hello,\r\n\r\nThe issue is still happening in version `less@3.12.2`.\r\n\r\nAs @HQ-Lin commented, it happens when you have a variable without semi colon at the end of the block.\r\n\r\nThis can be fixed by adding the semi colon if you are the owner of the code, but in case of a third-party library it is not viable.\r\n\r\nI am using `lessc file.less --clean-css=\"--s1 --advanced\"` to minify some files that later are used in other projects.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/comments/1283873011/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"moelders","id":2640252,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDAyNTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2640252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/moelders","html_url":"https://github.com/moelders","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moelders/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moelders/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moelders/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moelders/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moelders/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moelders/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moelders/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moelders/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moelders/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":7620682360,"node_id":"MEE_lADOAAgNHM4ZBu0OzwAAAAHGOmJ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/events/7620682360","a